# LockPlus
scrub in all fragment reassemble
scrub out all fragment reassemble
pass quick on lo0 all
pass out quick on utun4 proto {tcp, udp} to 10.0.0.1 port 53 flags any
pass out quick on utun7 proto {tcp, udp} to 10.0.0.1 port 53 flags any
block drop out quick proto {tcp, udp} to any port 53
pass out quick proto udp to 198.51.100.7 port 51820
pass out quick proto udp to 2001:db8::7 port 51820
pass out quick proto tcp to 192.0.2.10 port 443 flags any
pass out quick proto udp from any port 68 to any port 67
pass out quick proto udp from any port 546 to any port 547
pass quick inet6 proto ipv6-icmp icmp6-type {133, 134, 135, 136}
pass quick on utun4 all
pass quick on utun7 all
block drop out all
block drop in all
